544 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (As we outlined in our recent Responsible Tech Guide \(2025\), our organization believes in a human-centered future that values our agency in desired outcomes and rejects tech determinism. As such, we are focused on elevating AI models that do as little harm as possible, for use cases in which risks have been carefully considered and meaningfully mitigated; and ethically deployed AI, in which lofty principles are operationalized with grounded KPIs.)
/E (As we outlined in our recent Responsible Tech Guide \(2025\), our organization believes in a human-centered future that values our agency in desired outcomes and rejects tech determinism. As such, we are focused on elevating AI models that do as little harm as possible, for use cases in which risks have been carefully considered and meaningfully mitigated; and ethically deployed AI, in which lofty principles are operationalized with grounded KPIs.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
