/T (Safety AI safety, in the RAI context, confronts at least four interlocking obligations: 1\) shape model behavior before release, 2\) prevent catastrophic misuse in the wild, 3\) set and enforce risk thresholds that reflect public, not corporate, interests, and 4\) detect and contain failures in real-time once systems can act. )
/E (Safety AI safety, in the RAI context, confronts at least four interlocking obligations: 1\) shape model behavior before release, 2\) prevent catastrophic misuse in the wild, 3\) set and enforce risk thresholds that reflect public, not corporate, interests, and 4\) detect and contain failures in real-time once systems can act. )
/Pg 14 0 R
>>
