/T (Across all of this, we see Responsible AI literacy as the through-line. Next year we will expand our education work so that RAI is not just the domain of experts and insiders, but a shared civic competency: expanding our course offerings beyond the initial five released in 2025 and reworking our course library for additional audiences and platforms. )
/E (Across all of this, we see Responsible AI literacy as the through-line. Next year we will expand our education work so that RAI is not just the domain of experts and insiders, but a shared civic competency: expanding our course offerings beyond the initial five released in 2025 and reworking our course library for additional audiences and platforms. )
/Pg 42 0 R
/K [8]
