/E (Second, Synthetic Companions and Synthetic Media: we intend to amplify efforts to ensure AI companions reduce isolation rather than deepen it, support governance for high-risk use with teens and vulnerable users, and strengthen information integrity and content provenance efforts in a world where it is increasingly hard to tell who, or what, is speaking.  )
