/T (Third, Trust and Assurance: we will prioritize the connective tissue of AI governance, including standards, benchmarks, evaluations, audits, and red teaming, so that industry assurance efforts rest on a more robust intra-party system of trust. We intend to engage in civil society efforts to lead in building the accountability frameworks that Agentic AI will demand. )
/E (Third, Trust and Assurance: we will prioritize the connective tissue of AI governance, including standards, benchmarks, evaluations, audits, and red teaming, so that industry assurance efforts rest on a more robust intra-party system of trust. We intend to engage in civil society efforts to lead in building the accountability frameworks that Agentic AI will demand. )
