1193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (All Tech Is Human is a nonprofit organization dedicated to building a more responsible, inclusive, and ethical tech future by uniting a broad range of people and ideas across civil society, government, industry, and academia. Our whole-of-ecosystem approach brings together technologists, academics, civil society leaders, and everyday individuals to collaboratively address complex challenges around AI governance, digital rights, platform accountability, and the broader social impacts of technology. )
/E (All Tech Is Human is a nonprofit organization dedicated to building a more responsible, inclusive, and ethical tech future by uniting a broad range of people and ideas across civil society, government, industry, and academia. Our whole-of-ecosystem approach brings together technologists, academics, civil society leaders, and everyday individuals to collaboratively address complex challenges around AI governance, digital rights, platform accountability, and the broader social impacts of technology. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (We aim to develop a better approach for tackling thorny tech & society issues; one that leverages collective intelligence, involvement, and action to create needed systemic change.)
/E (We aim to develop a better approach for tackling thorny tech & society issues; one that leverages collective intelligence, involvement, and action to create needed systemic change.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Through community-building, talent cultivation, public programming, research, and analysis, our organization fosters dialogue that bridges gaps between disciplines and encourages shared responsibility for shaping technology that aligns with our values. By fostering collaboration and elevating a wide range of perspectives, All Tech Is Human works to ensure that technology is shaped by and for the public interest.)
/E (Through community-building, talent cultivation, public programming, research, and analysis, our organization fosters dialogue that bridges gaps between disciplines and encourages shared responsibility for shaping technology that aligns with our values. By fostering collaboration and elevating a wide range of perspectives, All Tech Is Human works to ensure that technology is shaped by and for the public interest.)
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
