1200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Rooted in practical insights and real-world applications, this series of five short courses, which can be completed in just a few hours, offers an introductory understanding of the foundations of Responsible AI: its principles, history, and evolution as a field, as well as an exploration of current roles, industry best practices, and the evolving governance landscape. )
/E (Rooted in practical insights and real-world applications, this series of five short courses, which can be completed in just a few hours, offers an introductory understanding of the foundations of Responsible AI: its principles, history, and evolution as a field, as well as an exploration of current roles, industry best practices, and the evolving governance landscape. )
/Pg 44 0 R
/K [5]
